an optimizing brainfuck compiler for Linux AMD64, (and cross-platform interpreter)

Note: right now the interpreter (should) runs on any POSIX complient system.
However, in the future it will only run on any POSIX complient system such that
getopt() moves non-option arguments to the end of argv

there is a compiler located at compiler/
and there is an interpreter located at interpreter/

that's all!

brainfuck examples:
https://copy.sh/brainfuck

